onfiguration-swift.class\/devicePropertyAllowList`` configuration.\n        - Will not depend on [`SDWebImage`](https:\/\/github.com\/SDWebImage\/SDWebImage).\n        - Will not support GIFs out of the box.\n\n        See our migration guide for instructions to properly migrate each feature: https:\/\/braze-inc.github.io\/braze-swift-sdk\/documentation\/braze\/appboy-migration-guide\n        ","deprecated":true,"beta":false}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"c:@CM@BrazeKit@objc(cs)Braze(cm)startWithApiKey:inApplication:withLaunchOptions:withAppboyOptions:","modules":[{"name":"BrazeKit"}],"extendedModule":"BrazeKit"},"deprecationSummary":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"\n        Migrating the SDK initialization to the 'Braze(configuration:)' initializer disables most compatibility features. This step should be performed last in your migration process.\n\n        After updating the SDK initialization and configuration, the SDK:\n        - Will not read the `Info.plist` based SDK configuration.\n        - Will not be compatible with `BrazeKitCompat` (`AppboyKit`) symbols.\n        - Will not be compatible with `BrazeUICompat` (`AppboyUI`) UI components.\n        - Will not emit the Content Cards updates via the Notification Center.\n        - Will not automatically use the `BrazeLocation` library.\n        - Will not read the [`identifierForVendor`](https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/uikit\/uidevice\/1620059-identifierforvendor) as part of the ``Braze\/Configuration-swift.class\/devicePropertyAllowList`` configuration.\n        - Will not depend on [`SDWebImage`](https:\/\/github.com\/SDWebImage\/SDWebImage).\n        - Will not support GIFs out of the box.\n\n        See our migration guide for instructions to properly migrate each feature: https:\/\/braze-inc.github.io\/braze-swift-sdk\/documentation\/braze\/appboy-migration-guide\n        "}],"type":"paragraph"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/braz